  data: {
    LLM: 'Track which tiles have been played; the player who can count outstanding tiles has an advantage.\n\nNote numbers on which an opponent was unable to play to infer their hand and block scoring opportunities.\n\nValuable tiles that move one scoring position to another: 0-3, 1-4, 2-5, 3-6, double 3, and double 6; use them to set up or deny multiples of 3 and 5.',
